# The Shadower's first class node: four dashes through the crowd, each slashing
# everything it passes.
#
# GMS's own figures: 720+20x% six times on twelve enemies, four presses per 60s
# cooldown. The client has an id per dash (400041002 chains through 400041003-5,
# all three `invisible`), and the 6th job boost raises the count from 4, which
# settles the number the tooltip muddles as "2-4".
#
# Here one press uses all four dashes: 420ms of frames each, with
# `cast_interval_ms` spacing them on that beat so each hits the crowd as it is
# then, instead of all four landing on one group of twelve. The three follow-ups
# fall inside the 1680ms the press costs, so nothing is free.
#
# The crit rate and Ignore DEF apply to this swing only, as GMS states. Dropped:
# the 300 MP, the immunity while dashing, and the dash direction, since nothing
# here has a position.
name: "Shadow Assault"
description: "Instantly move to slash enemies."
kind: SKILL_KIND_ATTACK
placement { job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_SHADOWER_V skill_order: 1 }
v_node: V_NODE_KIND_JOB
max_level: 30
required_equip_type: EQUIP_TYPE_DAGGER
base_delay_ms: 1680
cooldown_seconds: 60.0
max_enemies: 12
lines: 6
casts: 4
cast_interval_ms: 420
base {
  skill_pct: 7.40
  crit_rate: 0.25
  ied_pct: 1.00
}
per_level { skill_pct: 0.20 }
